1. c4 e5 2. Nc3 Nf6 3. g3 c6 4. Nf3 e4 5. Nd4 d5 6. cxd5 Qb6 7. e3 cxd5 8. Bg2 Nc6 9. Nxc6 bxc6 10. d3 Ba6 11. dxe4 dxe4 12. Qa4 Bb4 13. Bd2 Rd8 14. O-O-O O-O 15. h3 h6 16. a3 Bxc3 17. Bxc3 Nd5 18. Qd4 Nxc3 19. Qxc3 Bd3 20. Bf1 Rd5 21. Bxd3 exd3 22. Kb1 Rfd8 23. Rd2 Rf5 24. Qb4 Rb5 25. Qf4 Rb8 26. b4 Qa6 27. Kb2 c5 28. Rxd3 Rxb4+ 29. axb4 Rxb4+ 30. Qxb4 cxb4 31. Rhd1 Qf6+ 32. Kb3 a5 33. R1d2 Qa1 ({Some databases give the erroneous} 33... Qa6 {with the comment 'draw, 59 moves', presumably because the inputter cannot make sense of subsequent moves.}) 34. Kc4 Qc1+ 35. Kb3 Qa3+ 36. Kc4 Qa4 37. Rd4 Qc6+ 38. Kb3 Qc3+ 39. Ka4 Qa3+ 40. Kb5 b3 {"Here Spiridonov played} 41. Ka6 {What a strange move, I thought, and in a flash played} b2 $4 {and after} (41... a4 {wins easily}) 42. Rd8+ Kh7 43. Rb8 {I realised the point of 41 Ka6."} Qc3 44. Rbxb2 a4 45. Kb5 a3 46. Rbc2 Qb3+ 47. Kc5 Kg6 48. h4 Kf5 49. Kd4 Qb4+ 50. Kd3 g5 51. hxg5 hxg5 52. Ke2 Qb5+ 53. Rd3 g4 54. Ra2 Ke4 55. Raxa3 Qb2+ 56. Kf1 Qb1+ 57. Kg2 Qxd3 58. Rxd3 Kxd3 59. f3 Kxe3 60. fxg4 1/2-1/2

