1. a3 g6 2. g4 Bg7 3. Bg2 d5 4. h3 c5 5. d3 Nc6 6. Nc3 e6 7. Bf4 e5 8. Bd2 Nge7 9. e4 d4 10. Nce2 f6 11. b4 Qd6 12. Qb1 b6 13. f4 Be6 14. Nf3 O-O 15. f5 Bf7 16. b5 Na5 17. fxg6 hxg6 18. h4 f5 19. gxf5 gxf5 20. Ng5 f4 21. Bf3 Bf6 22. Nxf7 Kxf7 23. Qa2+ Kg7 24. Kf2 Kh8 25. Rag1 Bg7 26. Rg4 Bh6 27. Ng1 Rf6 28. Nh3 Qe6 29. Qb1 Raf8 30. Ng5 Qd7 31. a4 Nb7 32. Rgg1 Nd6 33. Bg4 Qb7 34. Nf3 Nf7 35. Rg2 Rg8 36. Qa2 Qc7 37. Rhg1 Nd8 {Position in CHESS} 38. Kf1 Rg7 39. Be1 Rf8 40. h5 Qd6 41. Bh4 {At this point the gong went for the end of the round, and Ilijc illegally made a quick move} Rfg8 {in order that I should have to seal. After some thought I hit on a move Ilijc would not consider in his adjournment analysis.} 42. Qc4 {(sealed)} Rf8 43. Bxe7 Qxe7 44. Qd5 Re8 45. Bf5 Rg3 46. Rxg3 fxg3 47. Rxg3 Bf4 48. Rg4 Qf7 49. Nh4 $1 Qxd5 50. Ng6+ Kg7 51. Nxf4+ Kh6 52. Nxd5 Rf8 53. Rg6+ Kxh5 54. Nf6+ Kh4 55. Rg4+ Kh3 56. Rg8+ {Source: Mega Database 2022; (part-game) CHESS, October 1979, Vol.44/825-6, p380} 1-0

