1. d4 h6 2. e4 g5 3. Bd3 Bg7 4. Ne2 c5 5. dxc5 Qa5+ 6. c3 Qxc5 7. Be3 Qc7 8. Ng3 Nc6 $2 (8... Nf6) 9. h4 $1 Be5 (9... gxh4 $6 10. Nh5 Bf8 11. Rxh4) 10. Nh5 d6 11. hxg5 hxg5 12. Bxg5 Qb6 13. Qb3 Bg4 14. Be2 Qxb3 15. axb3 Rxh5 16. Rxh5 Bxh5 17. Bxh5 Nf6 18. Bf3 Kd7 19. Nd2 Rg8 {Black did not have compen­sation for the lost pawn. Hardly a good advertisement for Black's system but the improvement on move 8 is significant.} 20. Be3 a6 21. g3 Ng4 22. Bb6 Bf6 23. Ke2 Nge5 24. Bg2 e6 25. Rh1 Ke7 26. Rh7 Nd7 27. Be3 Nde5 28. Bh3 Nd7 29. Nc4 b5 30. Nd2 a5 31. Rh5 Rb8 32. f4 a4 33. Bg2 b4 34. e5 bxc3 35. bxc3 Ndxe5 36. fxe5 Nxe5 37. bxa4 Ra8 38. Bxa8 {Source: 'The Killer Grob' by Michael Basman (Pergamon)} 1-0

