1. g4 e5 2. c4 h5 3. gxh5 Rxh5 4. Nc3 Nc6 5. d3 d6 6. Bg2 Nf6 7. h4 Ng4 8. Nf3 Nd4 9. Bg5 f6 10. Bd2 f5 11. Bg5 Be7 12. Bxe7 Qxe7 13. Nxd4 exd4 14. Nd5 Qd8 15. Qa4+ c6 16. Nf4 Rh6 $1 ({"Arkell played this move fairly speedily, declining the sacrifice. I now began to feel I had shot my bolt. I was an hour behind on the clock and had not achieved the desired 'forced win'. However, the forcing variation had led to some benefits for White and, by a regrouping manoeuvre, White retakes the initiative." After} 16... Rxh4 {Basman intended} 17. Bxc6+ bxc6 18. Rxh4 Qxh4 19. Qxc6+ Kd8 (19... Kf7 20. Qd5+ Ke8 21. O-O-O Qxf2 22. Qg8+ Kd7 23. Nd5) 20. O-O-O Nxf2 21. Qxd6+ Ke8 22. Rg1 Qh6 23. Qe5+ Kf7 24. Kc2) 17. h5 Bd7 18. Qb4 Qc7 19. Qd2 O-O-O 20. b4 Kb8 21. a4 d5 $1 22. cxd5 Qe5 $1 23. Ng6 Qd6 24. Rc1 cxd5 25. Rc5 Bc6 26. Qg5 a5 $1 27. bxa5 Be8 $1 28. Nf4 Rf6 29. Rc1 Qb4+ 30. Kf1 Qd2 31. Re1 Bxa4 32. Bf3 Rd7 33. Kg2 Ka7 34. Ra1 Bc6 35. Rhd1 Qc3 36. Ng6 Qc5 37. Qf4 Qd6 38. Qxd4+ Kb8 39. Rh1 Re6 40. Nf4 Re8 41. a6 Re4 42. dxe4 Qxf4 43. axb7 Rxb7 44. Rh3 Ne5 45. e3 Nxf3 46. Rxf3 Qg4+ 47. Rg3 Qxe4+ 48. Qxe4 fxe4 49. Rg5 Rf7 50. Rg6 Bb7 51. Ra4 Kc7 52. Kg1 Kc8 53. Rb4 Kc7 54. Kf1 Bc8 55. Rb5 Bb7 56. Ke2 Kd8 57. Rb1 Ke8 58. h6 {Sources: bulletin; 'The Killer Grob' by Michael Basman (Pergamon)} 1-0

